{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a scene to save and load whole worlds, such as a game’s save file or a level made in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editor, or to store a group of entities you spawn many times, such as an enemy squad. Take a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scene with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/scene(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", passing a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry"},{"type":"text","text":" of the types to save. Then either"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rebuild the whole world with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"World(restoring:)"},{"type":"text","text":", or add the scene’s entities to another"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"world as new ones with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/spawn(contentsOf:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A scene is ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Encoding needs nothing more; decoding needs the registry in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"decoder’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"userInfo","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" under ","type":"text"},{"code":"CodingUserInfoKey.typeRegistry","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","","var registry = TypeRegistry()","try registry.register(Name.self, named: \"Name\")","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Ship\"))","let turret = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Turret\"))","try world.addChild(turret, to: ship)","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(world.scene(registry))","","let decoder = JSONDecoder()","decoder.userInfo[.typeRegistry] = registry","let scene = try decoder.decode(Scene.self, from: data)","print(scene.count)","\/\/ Prints \"2\"","","let restored = World(restoring: scene)","print(restored.parent(of: turret) == ship)","\/\/ Prints \"true\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Restoring keeps every entity handle, live or stale, meaning the same as in the original"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"world, and the restored world hands out the same handles from later spawns. Types the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registry names but the data doesn’t are left out."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A scene holds no hooks, observers, caches, indexes or change ticks, and the restored world’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"components are all added at its first tick.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decoding throws "},{"code":"DecodingError.dataCorrupted","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when the decoder’s "},{"code":"userInfo","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registry, when the data names a type the registry doesn’t, or for data that no world could"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"have produced."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryLookupError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MapEntities"],"title":"Saving and Loading Worlds","generated":true,"anchor":"Saving-and-Loading-Worlds"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"A saved copy of a world’s entities, hierarchy, and the components and resources of the types","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a registry names.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/scene"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/Se","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SE","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"metadata":{"title":"Scene","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"symbolKind":"struct","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Scene.swift#L664","fileName":"Scene.swift"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:11WorldModule5SceneV"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene\/init(from:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene\/componentNames","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene\/count","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentat